/* ACL -- show and modify the configuration of ACL users.
 * ACL HELP
 * ACL LOAD
 * ACL SAVE
 * ACL LIST
 * ACL USERS
 * ACL CAT [<category>]
 * ACL SETUSER <username> ... acl rules ...
